data: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":28,"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"success\":true,\"work_package\":{\"id\":47,\"subject\":\"Request priority hosting-capacity refresh and feeder re-study for ALN-108\",\"description\":\"Follow-up to WP44 (Northline ALN-108 pre-application response, 07/14/2025). HCM-2024-Q2 (published 05/15/2024) still shows 3.0 MW for ALN-108, but post-publication queue entries PXA-2024-0231 (1.2 MW, queued 09/18/2024) and PXA-2025-0044 (1.0 MW, queued 02/06/2025) reduce current available capacity to 0.8 MW. Action: place ALN-108 on the priority list for a feeder-level re-study and map refresh under the HCM refresh criteria (application date, capacity requested relative to headroom, pure-generation weighting); record the schedule and re-study result. The published 3.0 MW remains the map value of record until republication; the 0.8 MW figure applies for pre-application and sizing purposes in the interim. Owner: June Halloway, Distribution Planning. Due: 08/15/2025.\",\"status\":\"New\",\"type\":\"Task\",\"priority\":\"High\",\"assignee\":\"June Halloway\",\"author\":\"OpenProject Admin\",\"project_id\":3,\"done_ratio\":0,\"start_date\":\"2025-07-14\",\"due_date\":\"2025-08-15\",\"ignore_non_working_days\":false,\"created_at\":\"2026-11-19T12:32:23.585Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-11-19T12:32:23.585Z\"},\"error\":\"\",\"warning\":\"\"}"}],"structuredContent":{"success":true,"work_package":{"id":47,"subject":"Request priority hosting-capacity refresh and feeder re-study for ALN-108","description":"Follow-up to WP44 (Northline ALN-108 pre-application response, 07/14/2025). HCM-2024-Q2 (published 05/15/2024) still shows 3.0 MW for ALN-108, but post-publication queue entries PXA-2024-0231 (1.2 MW, queued 09/18/2024) and PXA-2025-0044 (1.0 MW, queued 02/06/2025) reduce current available capacity to 0.8 MW. Action: place ALN-108 on the priority list for a feeder-level re-study and map refresh under the HCM refresh criteria (application date, capacity requested relative to headroom, pure-generation weighting); record the schedule and re-study result. The published 3.0 MW remains the map value of record until republication; the 0.8 MW figure applies for pre-application and sizing purposes in the interim. Owner: June Halloway, Distribution Planning. Due: 08/15/2025.","status":"New","type":"Task","priority":"High","assignee":"June Halloway","author":"OpenProject Admin","project_id":3,"done_ratio":0,"start_date":"2025-07-14","due_date":"2025-08-15","ignore_non_working_days":false,"created_at":"2026-11-19T12:32:23.585Z","updated_at":"2026-11-19T12:32:23.585Z"},"error":"","warning":""},"isError":false}}

