data: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":65,"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"success\":true,\"work_package\":{\"id\":49,\"subject\":\"Prepare for and hold the 07/29/2025 Northline ALN-108 pre-application meeting\",\"description\":\"Follow-up to WP44 (Northline ALN-108 pre-application response, 07/14/2025). Prepare for and hold the offered pre-application dialogue meeting on 07/29/2025, 10:00-11:00 Central (calendar event ID 4926df7e-ca59-4928-81a8-a8a27aa430ce), at 4200 Veldmere Boulevard or by video conference. Confirm Northline attendance by 07/22/2025; collect the single-line diagram, inverter specifications, site plan and target in-service date three business days before; record meeting notes and outcome. If 07/29 is not workable, offer 08/05/2025 at the same time. The meeting covers the 0.8 MW capacity record, the sizing options and formal application requirements; it does not reserve capacity or a queue position. Owner: June Halloway, Distribution Planning. Due: 07/29/2025.\",\"status\":\"New\",\"type\":\"Task\",\"priority\":\"High\",\"assignee\":\"June Halloway\",\"author\":\"OpenProject Admin\",\"project_id\":3,\"done_ratio\":0,\"start_date\":\"2025-07-15\",\"due_date\":\"2025-07-29\",\"ignore_non_working_days\":false,\"created_at\":\"2026-11-19T12:44:49.059Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-11-19T12:44:49.059Z\"},\"error\":\"\",\"warning\":\"\"}"}],"structuredContent":{"success":true,"work_package":{"id":49,"subject":"Prepare for and hold the 07/29/2025 Northline ALN-108 pre-application meeting","description":"Follow-up to WP44 (Northline ALN-108 pre-application response, 07/14/2025). Prepare for and hold the offered pre-application dialogue meeting on 07/29/2025, 10:00-11:00 Central (calendar event ID 4926df7e-ca59-4928-81a8-a8a27aa430ce), at 4200 Veldmere Boulevard or by video conference. Confirm Northline attendance by 07/22/2025; collect the single-line diagram, inverter specifications, site plan and target in-service date three business days before; record mee