data: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":15,"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"success\":true,\"work_package\":{\"id\":48,\"subject\":\"Track any Northline ALN-108 formal application following the 07/29/2025 meeting\",\"description\":\"Follow-up to WP44 (Northline ALN-108 pre-application response, 07/14/2025). The 07/29/2025 pre-application meeting itself is handled under WP49. Action: if Northline Renewables files a formal interconnection application, record the application ID, the completeness determination and queue date under Tariff §12.3, and route by filed capacity: (a) at 3 MW, medium-scale classification and system impact study under DIS-01 Rev 4 Table 3-1, with the full Table 5-1 Category 3 protective, metering and telemetry set; (b) at 500 kW to 0.8 MW, commercial small-scale classification and initial screening plus supplemental review under SRP-3, with TCS-02 §5 telemetry, the Category 2 DER-side disconnect and revenue meter, and a Form ER-11 referral under DIS-01 §8 / ERP-9 §3 for the Category 2 \\\"POI recloser not required\\\" entry versus DPS-07 Rev 2 §4.2 before protective-equipment scoping is finalized. Record the relation to the 07/14/2025 response. No capacity or queue position is reserved by the pre-application. Owner: June Halloway, Distribution Planning. Due: 08/18/2025.\",\"status\":\"New\",\"type\":\"Task\",\"priority\":\"Normal\",\"assignee\":\"June Halloway\",\"author\":\"OpenProject Admin\",\"project_id\":3,\"done_ratio\":0,\"start_date\":\"2025-08-18\",\"due_date\":\"2025-08-18\",\"ignore_non_working_days\":false,\"created_at\":\"2026-11-19T12:32:25.407Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-11-19T13:40:53.084Z\"},\"error\":\"\",\"warning\":\"\"}"}],"structuredContent":{"success":true,"work_package":{"id":48,"subject":"Track any Northline ALN-108 formal application following the 07/29/2025 meeting","description":"Follow-up to WP44 (Northline ALN-108 pre-application response, 07/14/2025). The 07/29/2025 pre-application meeting itself is handled under WP49. Action: if Northline Renewables files a formal interconnection application, record the application ID, the completeness determination and queue date under Tariff §12.3, and route by filed capacity: (a) at 3 MW, medium-scale classification and system impact study under DIS-01 Rev 4 Table 3-1, with the full Table 5-1 Category 3 protective, metering and telemetry set; (b) at 500 kW to 0.8 MW, commercial small-scale classification and initial screening plus supplemental review under SRP-3, with TCS-02 §5 telemetry, the Category 2 DER-side disconnect and revenue meter, and a Form ER-11 referral under DIS-01 §8 / ERP-9 §3 for the Category 2 \"POI recloser not required\" entry versus DPS-07 Rev 2 §4.2 before protective-equipment scoping is finalized. Record the relation to the 07/14/2025 response. No capacity or queue position is reserved by the pre-application. Owner: June Halloway, Distribution Planning. Due: 08/18/2025.","status":"New","type":"Task","priority":"Normal","assignee":"June Halloway","author":"OpenProject Admin","project_id":3,"done_ratio":0,"start_date":"2025-08-18","due_date":"2025-08-18","ignore_non_working_days":false,"created_at":"2026-11-19T12:32:25.407Z","updated_at":"2026-11-19T13:40:53.084Z"},"error":"","warning":""},"isError":false}}

