; collect the single-line diagram, inverter specifications, site plan and target in-service date three business days before; record meeting notes and outcome. If 07/29 is not workable, offer 08/05/2025 at the same time. The meeting covers the 0.8 MW capacity record, the sizing options, the Category 3 and Category 2 protection/telemetry conditions (including the DIS-01/DPS-07 POI recloser conflict and the ERP-9 route) and formal application requirements; it does not reserve capacity or a queue position. Owner: June Halloway, Distribution Planning. Due: 07/29/2025.","status":"New","type":"Task","priority":"High","assignee":"June Halloway","author":"OpenProject Admin","project_id":3,"done_ratio":0,"start_date":"2025-07-15","due_date":"2025-07-29","ignore_non_working_days":false,"created_at":"2026-11-19T12:44:49.059Z","updated_at":"2026-11-19T13:40:54.797Z"},"error":"","warning":""},"isError":false}}

