data: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":21,"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"success\":true,\"work_package\":{\"id\":47,\"subject\":\"Request priority hosting-capacity refresh and feeder re-study for ALN-108\",\"description\":\"Follow-up to WP44 (Northline ALN-108 pre-application response, 07/14/2025). HCM-2024-Q2 (published 05/15/2024) still shows 3.0 MW for ALN-108, but post-publication queue entries PXA-2024-0231 (1.2 MW, queued 09/18/2024) and PXA-2025-0044 (1.0 MW, queued 02/06/2025) reduce current available capacity to 0.8 MW. Priority-refresh request under RA-2025-07-01 §3.7 was raised and recorded 07/14/2025, before the response figure was communicated; the HCM refresh criteria are application date, capacity requested relative to headroom, and pure-generation weighting. Action: complete the priority listing, schedule the feeder-level re-study and map refresh, and record both. Confirm with the DER Planning Group why PXA-2024-0231 is shown as \\\"system impact study\\\" in the 07/14/2025 Active Queue Report but has no row in the 07/14/2025 SIS Backlog Status (DPG-SIS-BL-2025-07 Rev 1), and record the reconciled status before the re-study. The published 3.0 MW remains the map value of record until a later edition is issued; the 0.8 MW figure applies for pre-application and sizing purposes in the interim. Owner: June Halloway, Distribution Planning. Start: 07/14/2025. Due: 08/18/2025.\",\"status\":\"New\",\"type\":\"Task\",\"priority\":\"High\",\"assignee\":\"June Halloway\",\"author\":\"OpenProject Admin\",\"project_id\":3,\"done_ratio\":0,\"start_date\":\"2025-08-18\",\"due_date\":\"2025-08-18\",\"ignore_non_working_days\":false,\"created_at\":\"2026-11-19T12:32:23.585Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-11-19T13:40:51.415Z\"},\"error\":\"\"}"}],"structuredContent":{"success":true,"work_package":{"id":47,"subject":"Request priority hosting-capacity refresh and feeder re-study for ALN-108","description":"Follow-up to WP44 (Northline ALN-108 pre-application response, 07/14/2025). HCM-2024-Q2 (published 05/15/2024) still shows 3.0 MW for ALN-108, but post-publication queue entries PXA-2024-0231 (1.2 MW, queued 09/18/2024) and PXA-2025-0044 (1.0 MW, queued 02/06/2025) reduce current available capacity to 0.8 MW. Priority-refresh request under RA-2025-07-01 §3.7 was raised and recorded 07/14/2025, before the response figure was communicated; the HCM refresh criteria are application date, capacity requested relative to headroom, and pure-generation weighting. Action: complete the priority listing, schedule the feeder-level re-study and map refresh, and record both. Confirm with the DER Planning Group why PXA-2024-0231 is shown as \"system impact study\" in the 07/14/2025 Active Queue Report but has no row in the 07/14/2025 SIS Backlog Status (DPG-SIS-BL-2025-07 Rev 1), and record the reconciled status before the re-study. The published 3.0 MW remains the map value of record until a later edition is issued; the 0.8 MW figure applies for pre-application and sizing purposes in the interim. Owner: June Halloway, Distribution Planning. Start: 07/14/2025. Due: 08/18/2025.","status":"New","type":"Task","priority":"High","assignee":"June Halloway","author":"OpenProject Admin","project_id":3,"done_ratio":0,"start_date":"2025-08-18","due_date":"2025-08-18","ignore_non_working_days":false,"created_at":"2026-11-19T12:32:23.585Z","updated_at":"2026-11-19T13:40:51.415Z"},"error":""},"isError":false}}

